From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kirill =?UTF-8?q?M=C3=BCller?= <kirill@cynkra.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Mark the normalized equivalence binding as used outside its
 assertion

QueryGraphManager::GetEquivalenceBinding() reads `normalized` only inside
D_ASSERT(), so in a release build -Wunused-variable reports it. A (void)
reference after the assertion marks it used, as upstream adds at the same
place in duckdb/duckdb@3d4faf1e69; the vendored tree lacks that line until
then.

Retired at duckdb/duckdb@3d4faf1e69, where upstream takes the line itself.
---
diff --git a/src/duckdb/src/optimizer/join_order/query_graph_manager.cpp b/src/duckdb/src/optimizer/join_order/query_graph_manager.cpp
--- a/src/duckdb/src/optimizer/join_order/query_graph_manager.cpp
+++ b/src/duckdb/src/optimizer/join_order/query_graph_manager.cpp
@@ -316,6 +316,7 @@
 	if (source.table_index.IsValid()) {
 		auto normalized = relation_manager.TryNormalizeBinding(source, binding);
 		D_ASSERT(normalized);
+		(void)normalized;
 	}
 }
 
